  "description": "Han Deul-gi, a true rebel of his era, meets Kim Yo-jo and begins a life as a full-time househusband in a bourgeois apartment complex. He happens to come across the Women’s Association of Building 201, and as he spends time with its members—women who are financially well-off but emotionally lonely—his long-forgotten rebellious spirit from his twenties begins to resurface...\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/Mr_husband)",
